~ start
Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
	Nathan: Here is a dramatic[wait=0.5] pause.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
- Second Start => secondStart
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

~ secondStart
Nathan: Hello this is the second start
=>< snippet
Nathan: Here are more choices
- First one
	Nathan: This is the first option
- Second one
	Nathan: This is the second option
=> END

~ snippet
Nathan: here is a snippet dialogue
=> END
